# The Tanzil text and every other pinned asset are checked by SHA-256. Git must
# never rewrite their line endings or the checksum stops matching and the widget
# refuses to render. This mirrors the upstream quran-turn repository.
#
# The upstream metadata file (quran-data.js) is deliberately absent from this
# repository: the generated Rust table is what gets committed, and regeneration
# reads the upstream file after checking its SHA-256.
assets/quran-uthmani.txt text eol=lf
assets/SHA256SUMS text eol=lf
*.woff2 binary
*.txt text eol=lf
